              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>A bedroom upgrade checklist can help you create a space that feels comfortable, organised, and relaxing for everyday living. Your bedroom is where you start and end each day, so small changes can significantly affect how the room feels. Many people look for bedroom upgrade ideas that don't need major renovations but still improve comfort and style. Simple changes like refreshing your bedding, adjusting the lighting, and decluttering can turn your bedroom into a welcoming space. Following a basic bedroom improvement checklist helps create an environment that supports rest and comfort every day.</p>",
