              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Lighting plays an important role in creating a relaxing bedroom. Bright overhead lights might be useful during the day, but softer lighting is often better for evenings when you want to unwind. Adding bedside lamps or softer bulbs can create a gentle and cosy atmosphere that encourages relaxation. Layered lighting also lets you adjust brightness depending on your needs, whether you are reading, resting, or preparing for sleep. Simple lighting adjustments are practical tips that can enhance the overall ambiance of your bedroom.</p>",
