              "blocks": {}
            },
            "text_hTGRpN": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Finally ironing your <a href=\"https://www.tangelos.co.uk/collections/flat-sheets\">cotton sheets</a> is a step in keeping them crisp and smooth. You should iron your sheets while they are still a bit damp. This helps smooth out the fabric and makes them feel crisp. Ironing your sheets is what gives them that luxury hotel feel. It helps keep your cotton sheets crisp and makes your bed feel cool and breathable.</p><p>Your bedroom is a place where you want to feel calm and relaxed. If your bedroom is messy and cluttered, it can make you feel anxious. If you keep your bedroom clean and organised, it is a lot nicer. You can start by cleaning up your bedside tables and putting things away in their places. This will make your bedroom feel bigger. You can also look at our <a href=\"https://www.tangelos.co.uk/collections/organic-cotton-percale-bedding%22\">breathable cotton bedding</a>. We have lots of options that can help you sleep better. Adding some touches like throws and cushions can make your bedroom feel cosier. You can also add some plants to make it feel more natural. These little things can make a difference in how your bedroom feels. They can help make your bedroom a nice place to be, which is great for your life.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
